1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,020
MEN: I'm terribly sorry, but I won't be able to show you the house you mentioned over the phone this morning.

2
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:09,836
The owner went away for the weekend and was supposed to be back this morning,

3
00:00:09,836 --> 00:00:12,800
but he just called and said he won't be back until tomorrow

4
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:14,160
because his flight got canceled.

5
00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:17,660
WOMAN: That's terrible. I got off work an hour early

6
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:20,200
and drove all the way across town to see this house.

7
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:24,260
Isn't there any possible chance that I could at least take a look around the yard?

8
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:27,100
MEN: Well, I am sure that the owner won't mind

9
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:29,200
if we checked out the house. Give me a second.

10
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:32,060
I will call his hotel and ask for his permission

11
00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:35,020
In the meantime, would you like some coffee?

12
00:00:35,020 --> 00:00:39,040
WOMAN: Yes, that would be nice. I take mine black, please.
